Krystilia's tasks become much more efficient at higher combat levels. Additionally, the player is more readily able to defend themselves against higher level PKers. There are also [[Krystilia/Strategies#Useful_shortcuts|agility shortcuts]] that can help to escape from [[player killers]] (PKers), the highest of which requires 89 agility. Having 77 will aid in escaping from the [[Wilderness Slayer Cave]], covering most of the important shortcuts. Even access to lower level shortcuts is a bonus.

As you are in the [[Wilderness]], the last thing you want to do is [[Skull (status)|skull]], so enable [[PK Skull Prevention]]. Skulling in the Wilderness means you are limited to keeping only one item in [[Items Kept on Death]] only if [[Protect Item]] is activated and not deactivated by [[Smite]]. If you die while skulled while Protect Item was deactivated or [[smited]], you '''will''' lose all items.

'''Note:''' Also, [[Accept Aid]] should be set to off, as it can be used by PKers in conjunction with [[Lunar spellbook|Lunar spells]] to either distract their target or intentionally heal their target to drain more of their prayer with [[Smite]]. 

